From 2dff1e605ba139e810e0ac0da9bdc6764c00b86f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 37/63] rule-set: the download, the start and the update of
 remote rule-sets

A remote rule-set starts empty when its first download fails and retries, its fetch is bounded by
stalls and by a start deadline, what cannot be a rule-set is refused before it is read, an answer
"not modified" writes the time alone, the download goes as an external connection, big lists update
one at a time, sets can be updated on request, the callbacks run after the cache write, a closed set
stops reading.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  9fc6e7edb rule-set: start empty when the first download fails, retry, run a hook
  212c548f1 rule-set: bound a remote fetch by stalls, start without a list that does not come
  2189fd7c6 rule-set: collect garbage after a load only, log repeated failures sparingly
  d66ef7ec7 rule-set: report how the recovered hook ended
  2f1b01f5d rule-set: read and drop the rules of a local set under its lock
  da13cdc32 rule-set: refuse what cannot be a rule-set before reading it, say what came
  f80bb7308 rule-set: download as an external connection
  4e7d6771b httpclient: test that what a request's context carries reaches the dialer
  a642e5c8c rule-set: one plain line of what the server said
  16cffb606 route: remote rule-sets can be updated on request
  7b78d1f9a route/rule: rule-set callbacks after the cache write; start empty on request
  3a214dab6 rule-set: a closed rule-set does not parse or save a list that came in
  dc4a0c7e7 rule-set: a rule set closed while it reads a list stops reading it
  3c1838a1b rule-set: an answer "not modified" writes the time alone to the cache file
  41f832ef9 patches: adapt to sing-box 1.14.4
  a1068a5cf rule-set updater: big lists one at a time

Pdk-Feature: rule-set
Pdk-Zone: core
Pdk-Layer: 04
